  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Drone Base X: Y" id="d5ff-b788-114a-0a60" hidden="false">
      <description>During this Unit&apos;s activation, it may launch one Squad of X Units of Y. Follow the usual Disembarking rules, treating this Unit as their Transport. Each launched Squad joins this Unit&apos;s Group. This Unit may not launch if 2 Y Squads are already in its Group. If this Unit is destroyed, all Y Squads in its Group are destroyed.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Guard" id="71fe-766a-b20f-4b34" hidden="false">
      <description>This Squad gains +2DF in CQBs. In addition, per Squad with two or more Guard Units in a CQB, one friendly Squad of your choosing gains +2DF for that CQB, assigned at the start of step 1 of that CQB.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Remote Drone" id="1cd2-e3d6-3021-681a" hidden="false">
      <description>This Squad may not be taken in your Army. During its activation, you may destroy this Squad instead of attacking with it.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
